<title>PHILIPPINES: ARCO, Preussag in Philippine venture.</title>
<headline>ARCO, Preussag in Philippine venture.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Richfield Co, German group Preussag and the Malaysian Mining Co have joined an oil exploration consortium to drill a deepwater area in the Sulu Sea in southern Philippines, officials said.</p>
<p>A top official from the Department of Energy (DOE) told Reuters on Monday the three companies will join Philippine operator Basic Petroleum &amp; Minerals Inc and other consortium members South China Petroleum &amp; Exploration and Oriental Petroleum &amp; Minerals.</p>
<p>The farm-in agreements were signed recently, the DOE official said.</p>
</text>
